    "/api/projects/{projectId}/scripts/{scriptId}/assets/images/generate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["剧本-资产"],
        "summary": "生成资产图片",
        "description": "根据资产提示词调用GPT-Image-2 API生成资产图片。直接POST api.apimart.ai/v1/images/generations，不走Dify工作流。支持文生图和图生图(referenceImageUrls参数)。参数：model=gpt-image-2, size=1:1, resolution=1k, n=1。支持两种模式：sync=true 同步阻塞轮询(最长120s,2s间隔)返回结果；sync=false 异步提交后立即返回,由后台调度器轮询。结果持久化到creative_asset表(asset_subtype=image, source=ai_image)，同步模式自动下载外部CDN图片存储到MinIO，按图片数量估算Token用量并从积分账户扣减。",
        "operationId": "generateImages",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "projectId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "项目唯一标识符",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "proj-abc123"
          },
          {
            "name": "scriptId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "剧本唯一标识符",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
